  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrade N14 road, Niassa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upgrade N14 road, Niassa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrade of the N14 road between Marrupa and Rua&#xe7;a to a surface        standard (with the same standard as the section from Litunde to       Marrupa). The project will provide bitumen paved two carriageway      road, following the SADC guidelines for Low Volume Sealed Roads. The  project is part of the Montepuez-Lichinga corridor co-financed        jointly with AfDB, JICA and GOM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upprustning/reparation av v&#xe4;g N14 mellan Marrupa och Rua&#xe7;a.           V&#xe4;gstr&#xe4;ckan rustas till samma standard som p&#xe5; sektionen mellan        Litunde och Marrupa (asfalterad med en k&#xf6;rbana i vardera riktning).   Upprustningen sker i enlighet med SADC guilinens for Low Volume       Sealed Roads. Projektet &#xe4;r en del i Montepuez-Lichinga korridor       projektet finansierat av AfDB, JICA och GOM.</narrative>
  </description>
